    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\"><ac:layout-cell><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Steps</span></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">1.&nbsp;From the clinical dashboard, click on the Consultation tab.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:image ac:width=\"623\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Screenshot 2021-12-06 at 10.54.48 AM.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></span></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">2. Order Medications</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Within the consultation page, choose Medication tab to order medicines as in screenshot below and click on SAVE.</span></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"note\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"b48f1cfb-399e-4b86-9f2b-e498ddd4bcba\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>To <strong>order sets of Medications</strong> please <a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/display/BAH/Using+Order+Sets\">refer to this page</a></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:image ac:width=\"623\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Screenshot 2021-12-06 at 10.56.21 AM.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"2\" /></ac:image></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:image ac:width=\"623\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Screenshot 2021-12-06 at 10.56.50 AM.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></span></p><p><span><span><br /></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">3. <strong>Order Tests</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Within the consultation page, choose Orders tab to order tests as in screenshot below and click on SAVE.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:image ac:width=\"623\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Screenshot 2021-12-06 at 10.56.02 AM.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></span></p></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"6462b5e2-1d86-451d-a8c5-c39c2f99335c\"><ac:rich-text-body><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Please note that Bahmni configuration for each implementation can vary drastically. The screens and workflows below may not apply to your specific implementation.</span></strong></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"0add60ca-db50-405a-bfd6-90945fbc2b0b\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#668D3C</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Feature Details</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Pharmacy Management\" ri:version-at-save=\"7\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Pharmacy Management - Feature Guide]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link></span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"55de8170-c071-4602-aacf-72d73bdf438e\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#668D3C</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Implementation Details</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Pharmacy Configuration\" ri:version-at-save=\"19\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Pharmacy Management - Implementer's Guide]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link></span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
