      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"OrderMedicationsand/orTests-Steps\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Steps</span></h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">1. From the clinical dashboard, click on the Consultation tab.</span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"623\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115217943/Screenshot%202021-12-06%20at%2010.54.48%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1638768475797&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=623&amp;height=285\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/115217943/Screenshot%202021-12-06%20at%2010.54.48%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1638768475797&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2947940364\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screenshot 2021-12-06 at 10.54.48 AM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"115217943\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"6\" data-media-id=\"356202e2-b66e-443d-b13e-12c2a22e77fe\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115217943/Screenshot%202021-12-06%20at%2010.54.48%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1638768475797&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1246&amp;height=570 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115217943/Screenshot%202021-12-06%20at%2010.54.48%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1638768475797&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=623&amp;height=285 1x\"></span></span></p><p><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">2. Order Medications</span></strong></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Within the consultation page, choose Medication tab to order medicines as in screenshot below and click on SAVE.</span></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"b48f1cfb-399e-4b86-9f2b-e498ddd4bcba\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>To <strong>order sets of Medications</strong> please <a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/display/BAH/Using+Order+Sets\" rel=\"nofollow\">refer to this page</a></p></div></div><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/></span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"623\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115217943/Screenshot%202021-12-06%20at%2010.56.21%20AM.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1638768605115&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=623&amp;height=326\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/115217943/Screenshot%202021-12-06%20at%2010.56.21%20AM.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1638768605115&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2947874833\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screenshot 2021-12-06 at 10.56.21 AM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"115217943\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"6\" data-media-id=\"1b0c2bf7-efd7-4c18-9a76-26f129