dificationDate=1638768682961&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=623&amp;height=321 1x\"></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">3. <strong>Order Tests</strong></span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Within the consultation page, choose Orders tab to order tests as in screenshot below and click on SAVE.</span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"623\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115217943/Screenshot%202021-12-06%20at%2010.56.02%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1638768651765&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=623&amp;height=247\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/115217943/Screenshot%202021-12-06%20at%2010.56.02%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1638768651765&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2948038671\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screenshot 2021-12-06 at 10.56.02 AM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"115217943\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"6\" data-media-id=\"1dbbb237-70ac-45e4-ab9f-57ac1a29b5b9\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115217943/Screenshot%202021-12-06%20at%2010.56.02%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1638768651765&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1246&amp;height=494 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115217943/Screenshot%202021-12-06%20at%2010.56.02%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1638768651765&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=623&amp;height=247 1x\"></span></span></